+ do is-class-type Bool
    - id TypeId

` Whether a type is a class whose values are objects, a style or a sheet of styles among them.
if id == no-type || id == invalid-type
    = false
if !intrinsic-is-class(completions[id].intrinsic)
    = false
do match? rows[id]
    | .type-class
        = true
= false

────────────────────
+ is-optional Bool
    - id TypeId

match rows[id]
    | .type-class(row)
        row.module == owner.module && row.decl == owner.decl && row.args.count == 1
    ??
        false

.. owner = type-decl(.optional)

